<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Cornick issues further cautionary.</title>
<headline>Cornick issues further cautionary.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Furniture group Pat Cornick Ltd said on Tuesday talks on transactions referred to in an announcement on July 3 were continuing.</p>
<p>If successfully concluded, the firm said the transactions could affect the price of its linked units on the Johannesburg Stock Exchange. It advised shareholder to exercise caution in their dealings until further notice.</p>
<p>The company gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
